Package: dragonpal
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, python3-tk
Recommends: python3-pil
Suggests: espeak
Maintainer: Haxnstuff <jlukasgammon@gmail.com>
Description: A little AI dragon that lives on your screen
 DragonPal is a floating desktop AI companion. It roams your screen, talks
 out loud, remembers you, reacts to text you copy, and can look at your
 screen with a vision model. This package installs the Python source plus a
 launcher and desktop entry.
